 *
 *  PARAMS
 *    note: A developer note that can be attached to the error payload
 *
 *  RETURNS
 *    A JSONObject
 *
 *  DEPENDENCIES
 *    GetLastErrorDataCustom: Core error data builder with customizable fields
 *
 *  CHANGELOG
 *    2023-09-28: Paul McCudden: Created
 *    2024-08-28: Paul McCudden: Split up location information
 *    2026-09-10: Paul McCudden: Refactored to call GetLastErrorDataCustom
*/

GetLastErrorDataCustom ( note )